    "UINiuZaiInsurance_titleOne": "Game area [Hit the game to get rewards corresponding to the odds]",
    "UINiuZaiXiaZhuQu_content01": "1. The win-loss zone: Cowboy wins, tie, bull wins;",
    "UINiuZaiXiaZhuQu_content02": "2. Anyone\u2019s hand card area: flush/concatenation/consecutive flush, pair pair A;",
    "UINiuZaiXiaZhuQu_content03": "3. Winning card type area: high card/one pair\u3001two pairs\u3001 three pairs/straight flush\u3001full house\u3001four of a kind/ straight flush",
    "UINiuZai_high_one": "High card/one pair",
    "UINiuZaiXiaZhuQu_content04": "Royal Flush",
    "UINiuZaiInsurance_titleTwo": "Card size [regardless of suit]",
    "UINiuZaiXiaZhuQu_content05": "1. Card type: Royal Flush> Straight Flush> Four of a Kind> Full House> Flush> Straight> Three of a Kind> Two Pairs> Pairs>",
    "UINiuZaiXiaZhuQu_content06": "High card;",
    "UINiuZaiXiaZhuQu_content07": "2. Single card: A>K>Q>J>10>9>8>7>6>5>4>3>2;",
    "UINiuZaiXiaZhuQu_content08": "3. Same card type: compare the largest single card first, if the same, continue to compare downwards at a time, such as 5 cards",
    "UINiuZaiXiaZhuQu_content09": "If the cards are the same, it is a tie;",
    "UINiuZaiInsurance_titleThree": "Blasting rules",
    "UINiuZaiXiaZhuQu_content011": "When the dealer's remaining stacks are not enough to pay out all of the winning players, the dealer's remaining stacks are",
    "UINiuZaiXiaZhuQu_content012": "The remaining points will be distributed to the winning players proportionally, and the table will be closed after the settlement is over",
