    "Membership benefits": "Member benefits",
    "UIJackpotRewardDescription_RewardTableTip": '"Jackpot Final Prize Amount" = Jackpot Pool * Game Type % * Level % * Card Type %',
    "UIJackpotRewardDescription_Instructions": "Jackpot usually refers to an additional bonus system that is played independently of the regular game and provides players participating in the game with the opportunity to win high bonuses!",
    "UIJackpotRewardDescription_Instructions2": 'Players typically need to opt-in to join the Jackpot game, where according to the rules, the winner of each hand needs to contribute an additional fee to the jackpot pool, known as the "Jackpot Contribution" (Jackpot drop).',
    "UIJackpotRewardDescription_Instructions3": "The triggering conditions of Jackpot are usually based on specific high-value card types. Common ones are Royal Flish, Flush, Four of a Kind, etc. When a player holds this card type in a hand, You can get Jacckpot bonus.",
    "UIJackpotRewardDescription_Instructions4": 'Additional conditions that need to be met for Jackpot:\\n1. The winning card type must be composed of two hole cards and community cards;\\n2. The special game requires the player in this hand to invest in the pot to reach the point of "investing in the pot to trigger the Jackpot reward" , can receive the Jackpot;\\n3. Players who leave the table before the Jackpot is settled are not counted in the Jackpot;\\n4. If there are multiple cards dealt, only the first time the cards are dealt can enjoy the Jackpot, and the largest card type is taken;\\n5. Players abandon Cards cannot trigger rewards, and they need to be revealed in the card stage;\\n6. Players must win cards to trigger Jackpot rewards;',
