    "IMNotificationTip": "When enabled, all pending messages from the club will be pushed to the IM hoverbox message list.",
    "BoundOtherTip": "This game account has been bound to other IM accounts. After opening, this IM account won\u2019t receive messages. Are you sure to open?",
    "UISquidQuitRoomTips": "You have not got the squid mark yet in currently squid game, and you need to pay the penalty amount when leaving the table",
    "UISquidDeposit": "Squid deposit",
    "UISquidRule": '<size=46>Squid game rules</size>\\n\\n1. The squid game is triggered when meet the squid game triggering conditions. \\n2. Each player (in current round of squid game) will get a squid mark after winning the pot for the first time, which will be displayed on the avatar on the table. A draw will not generate a squid mark. \\n3. When a player gets the "squid mark" and there is only one player left without the "squid mark", this round of squid game ends, and the last player needs to pay penalty points to other players. \\n4. If the player does not have enough balance to pay the penalty amount, the corresponding amount will be deducted from the deposit, and the player will be in a standing state. The player can bring in and sit down again\\n5. This round of squid game ends, all states are reset, and a new round is ready. Exiting the squid mode midway will be regarded as surrender and compensation will be required. Please be careful. \\n\\n<size=46>Exit and Penalty Rules</size>\\n\\n1. Players who leave actively, leave passively, or temporarily disconnect are all considered "leaving state". \\n2. If you are not in the squid mode, you will leave the table normally and entire deposit will be directly return when you leave; otherwise, you will need to deduct the penalty amount of the number of people who have obtained the "squid mark + 1" in the leaving state. \\n3. Players who are in the "leave state" and have a "squid mark" will leave the table after settlement, and the deposit will be returned without additional deductions. \\n\xA04. Players who are in the "leave state" and do not have a "squid mark" will pay the penalty amount to each player who has a "squid mark" and then leave the table after settlement. If the amount is not enough, it will be deducted from the deposit. \\n5. Player can continue and keep the same status If reconnects successfully within the countdown, and the squid game settlement is not triggered during the period. \\n6. The penalty amount for quitting midway will be put into the squid pool and will be divided equally among the players who have the squid mark after the end of this round of squid.',
