    "Mahjong_SelfDrawOptionTips": "Self-draw can choose 3 modes: +1x (last add), x2, or no double.",
    "Mahjong_PointKongOptionTips": "Point Kong Flower adds options, calculated based on two modes: self-draw or cannon\\nWhen it's self-draw: a discards to allow b to Kong, b draws a tile to win, it counts as self-draw, and all three opponents lose points;\\nWhen it's cannon: a discards to allow b to Kong, b draws a tile to win, it counts as cannon, and only a loses to b.",
    "Mahjong_RateTypeOptionTips": 'Winning hand type selection, there are 6 hand types available, all selected by default;\\n a. If a hand type is selected, it can win and will be calculated based on the corresponding multiplier;\\n b. If not selected, that hand type cannot win;\\n \\n The "No Meld" hand type is calculated separately, with the rule being: winning without any melds, exposed Kongs, final self-draw, or cannon. Dark Kongs still count as "No Meld."',
    "Mahjong_CallForwardingTips": "Call Transfer: When a player Kongs and another player wins by cannon, the Kong's reward is transferred to the winning player. Multiple winning players do not trigger call transfer.",
