    "UIViewAllPublicCardsTips": "View Successful",
    "Mahjong_RuleContent6_5": '"Call Forwarding", When a player causes a win after performing a kong, the points won from the kong must be transferred to the winning player.',
    "Mahjong_RuleContent7_2": '"Tax Refund", At the end of the hand, players who are not in a ready state must return all points gained from kong actions.',
    "Mahjong_RuleTitle19": "Buy-in Rules",
    "Mahjong_RuleContent19_1": 'The buy-in must be greater than "base stake \xd7 24". (Minimum buy-in equals "base stake \xd7 25"), If the player\'s chips fall to or below "base stake \xd7 24" during the game, they must stand up and add chips to continue playing',
    "UIMatch_ServerHead": "Official Support",
    "UICreateTableSquidModeTip": "Multiple players may win multiple squids; if only one player does not win a squid, the round ends;",
