    "Mahjong_BuyHorse": "Horse Betting",
    "Mahjong_BuyHorseTips": '1.Horse betting can only be chosen in the "self-draw only" winning mode, and only the winner of a self-draw win can place horse bets.\\n2. After the game ends with a winning hand, the horse cards are revealed by the winning player, drawn randomly from the remaining wall or a new deck (room option), based on card points: Characters, Bamboo, Dots 1, 5, 9, and East Wind are "winning horses," while others are "losing horses."\\n3. If the remaining wall does not have enough horse cards, only the available cards will be revealed.\\n4. If "winning horses" are drawn, each "winning horse" card corresponds to a double payout from each of the three non-winning players. If "losing horses" are drawn, no payout is made.\\n5. Kong cards are not included in the settlement of horse card wins or losses.',
