    "Mahjong_StandardRuleContent21_1": 'Horse betting can only be chosen in the "self-draw only" winning mode, and only the winner of a self-draw win can place horse bets;',
    "Mahjong_StandardRuleContent21_2": 'After the game ends with a winning hand, the horse cards are revealed by the winning player, drawn randomly from the remaining wall or a new deck (room option), based on card points: Characters, Bamboo, Dots 1, 5, 9, and East Wind are "winning horses," while others are "losing horses";',
