    "UITexasIns_InsAmount": "Premium",
    "UICreateTable_InsTips": "1. Classic Insurance\\nA risk control mechanism in Texas Hold'em that balances fluctuations and locks in partial profits early. Classic insurance is the most traditional and widely recognized form of insurance.\\n2. Low-Risk Insurance\\nInsurance can be purchased when the leading player goes all-in in the largest pot. The low-risk insurance premium is 10%, and the odds are higher than traditional insurance. It is an industry-first innovation, offering lower premiums with higher payouts.",
