    "UIMushroom_StartGameTips": "Welcome to Mushroom Mode\\n\\nBefore each hand begins, the dealer must add one mushroom worth {0} to the Mushroom Pot. When the small blind wins the low pot, they collect the current Mushroom Pot amount.",
    "UICreateTable_SquidLeaveTable": "Leave table mid-game",
    "UICreateTable_SquidLeaveTableTips": "In Squid Game mode, Off = cannot leave mid-game; On = can leave mid-game",
    "UISquid_StandupToast": "You need to wait until the current Squid Game round ends; you will stand up automatically",
    "UISquid_LeaveTableToast": "You cannot leave the table during Squid Game",
    "UIMyStatistics": "My stats",
    "UINumberOfParticipants": "Participants",
    "UITotalNumberOfTables": "Total tables",
    "UITableMyProfits": "My earnings",
    "UIStatisticalResults": "Statistics result",
    "UIDialogSquid_Tips1": "No one can leave mid-game. Exiting the room keeps you in away status until you return to the table or the current Squid Game round ends.",
    "UIDialogSquid_Tips2": "Players who have obtained a squid may leave anytime; players without a squid must wait until the Squid Game ends before they can exit",
    "UISquidNewRulerDetail": "<size=52>Squid Game Rules</size>\\n\\nSquid Game (Stand Up Game) is an elimination-style mode derived from Texas Hold\u2019em. Compared with traditional Hold\u2019em, it adds more competitive elements and makes the game more thrilling.\\n\\n<size=52>Winning & Losing</size>\\n\\n\u2022 Winner: Each time a player wins the pot, they receive one squid. Anyone holding a squid is a winner. (If the pot is split, no squid is awarded; with multiple pots, the main pot winner receives the squid.)\\n\\n\u2022 Loser: Players who do not obtain a squid are losers and will be penalized.\\n\\n<size=52>Rewards & Penalties</size>\\n\\n\u2022 Losers must pay a squid bonus from their balance; if insufficient, it is taken from the deposit. The amount depends on the winners\u2019 number of squids and the squid value.\\n\\n",
    "UISquidNewRulerClassic": "<size=52>Gameplay \u2014 Classic Mode</size>\\n\\n\u2022 The game auto-starts once conditions are met.\\n\\n\u2022 At the end of each hand, the main pot winner gains one squid; only one squid can be gained per hand.\\n\\n\u2022 When all squids have been distributed at the end of a hand, the game enters settlement, and all winners split the squid bonus paid by the last player.\\n\\n\u2022 Players who already have a squid may leave early; those without a squid must wait until the game ends before leaving the table.\\n\\n\u2022 If a player force-quits the room, the Squid Game ends immediately, and the leaving player compensates the others. If multiple players leave, the first leaver pays; players who leave simultaneously must all pay.\\n\\n\u2022 New players may join mid-game, and the total number of squids increases accordingly.\\n\\n",
    "UISquidNewRulerFlight": "<size=52>Gameplay \u2014 Blood Mode</size>\\n\\n\u2022 The game auto-starts once conditions are met.\\n\\n\u2022 At the end of each hand, the main pot winner receives a squid. Players can obtain multiple squids.\\n\\n\u2022 When the last player has not obtained a squid, or when all squids have been distributed and some players still have not obtained a squid, the game ends; players without a squid pay the compensation.\\n\\n\u2022 New players may join mid-game, and the total number of squids increases accordingly.\\n\\n",
    "UISquid_Tips1": "You cannot leave during Squid Game; you will stand up after the Squid Game ends",
    "UISquid_Tips2": "You have obtained a squid and have a big advantage in the upcoming hands. Leave now?",
    "UISquid_Tips3": "If you leave, the game will continue, and when it ends you will pay the squid bonus to other players",
    "UISquid_Tips4": "If you leave, you will pay the squid bonus to other players when the game ends",
